WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.624
The current local RankBid installation includes core RankLens analytics without a recurring subscription checkout.

00:00:06.624 --> 00:00:14.547
The billing view shows available access information; it does not take card details or create an invoice.

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:17.555
Bot traffic is a separate paid-access feature.

00:00:17.555 --> 00:00:23.573
In this build the owner verifies a customer's payment and enables the entitlement in admin.

00:00:23.573 --> 00:00:28.387
Do not assume an account has access until its status is active.

00:00:28.387 --> 00:00:32.398
The local build does not create a recurring billing charge.

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:37.437
A payment for a RankBid placement is not a RankLens subscription.

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:41.836
Provider receipts and bank settlement remain in the gateway account.

00:00:41.836 --> 00:00:50.195
Never label sandbox activity as a live payment; check the test-mode notice before using a screenshot or report externally.
